          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Dreamscapes: The Sandman is a hidden object puzzle adventure where players enter the subconscious of a coma patient named Laura. Using a specialized device to navigate her fractured dreams, the objective is to solve environmental puzzles and defeat the Sandman, an entity trapping her within her own mind.\n\nGameplay involves point-and-click exploration across various dream worlds, featuring logic-based mini-games and hidden object scenes. The experience focuses on collecting items to overcome character-driven fears, utilizing a progressive hint system to guide players through the narrative.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
